 All biomedical science coursework is taught by basic science and clinical faculty at the School of Medicine.\nFor more information, visit our Biomedical Graduate Programs homepage found on the School of Medicine website.\nGraduate Degree Programs:\nAddiction Research and Clinical Health (MS)\nBiomedical Engineering (MS, PhD)\nBiomedical Research (MS)\nBiomedical Science (MS)\nClinical Research Management (Online MS)\nGenetic Counseling (MS)\nIntegrative Physiology and Pharmacology (PhD)\nMedical Physics (PhD, MS, certificate)\nMolecular and Cellular Bioscience (PhD Admissions Track)\nBiochemistry and Molecular Biology (PhD)\nCancer Biology (PhD)\nMicrobiology and Immunology (PhD)\nMolecular Genetics and Genomics (PhD)\nMolecular Medicine and Translational Science (MS, PhD)\nNeuroscience (BS-BA/MS, MS, PhD)\nTranslational Biotechnology (MS, certificate)\nTranslational and Health System Science (MS, certificate)\nNon-Degree Programs:\nSummer Programs\nReport an issue with a webpage \u00bb\nQuad Cam\nWhere to Start\nRequest More Info\nAdmissions\nAbout\nAbout Winston-Salem\nNews & Events\nReynolda Campus\nApply\nAcademic Programs\nFinancial Aid\nStudent Resources\nHousing\n1834 Wake Forest Road\nWinston-Salem, NC 27109\nBowman Gray Campus\nApply\nBiomedical Programs\nFinancial Aid\nStudent Resources\nHousing\nPolicy\nAffiliates\nPrivacy\nEmergency\nNon-Discrimination\nEthics Hotline\nA Private Liberal Arts University in Winston-Salem, NC\nFounded 1834 / Motto: Pro Humanitate", "links": [["Wake Forest Privacy Statement (opens in a new tab)", "https://privacy.wfu.edu/"], ["Skip to main content", "https://graduate.wfu.edu/academic-programs-bowman-gray-campus/#skip_to_main_content"], ["", "https://graduate.wfu.edu/"], ["Faculty Resources", "https://graduate.wfu.edu/graduate-faculty-resources/"], ["Apply Now", "https://graduate.wfu.edu/apply-now-to-the-wake-forest-graduate-school/"], ["Request More Information", "https://graduate.wfu.edu/request-for-information/"], ["The G